### Variabel Lingkungan
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. GET Semua Layanan (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET Layanan Berdasarkan ID yang Ada (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/2
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET Layanan Berdasarkan ID Tidak Ada (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/999
Accept: application/json

### 4. POST Tambah Layanan Baru dengan URL Gambar (JSON) (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Cloud Architecture & DevOps",
  "description": "Perancangan dan implementasi infrastruktur cloud yang skalabel dan otomatis.",
  "icon": "cloud-arrow-up",
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
}

### 5. POST Tambah Layanan dengan Form-Data (Upload Gambar / URL) (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Mobile App Development
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Pengembangan aplikasi Android dan iOS berbasis Flutter & React Native.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="icon"

phone
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image_url"

https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512941937669-90a1b58e7e9c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80
--WebAppBoundary--

### 6. PUT Ubah Layanan pada ID yang Ada (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/services/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "UI UX Design (Updated)",
  "description": "User-centered design from wireframe to polished prototype, backed by consistent design systems.",
  "icon": "palette",
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581291518857-4e27b48ff24e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
}

### 7. PUT Ubah Layanan ID Tidak Ada (404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/services/999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Layanan Tidak Ditemukan",
  "description": "Testing update pada id yang tidak valid",
  "icon": "question"
}

### 8. DELETE Hapus Layanan pada ID yang Ada (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/services/5

### 9. DELETE Hapus Layanan ID Tidak Ada (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/services/999
